      {
        "text": "Stacy Fortner says she has degrees in business management and water systems technology. Her campaign website says she supports strong academic programs, career and technical education, and safe, supportive learning environments. At a candidate forum, she named three priorities: growing academic opportunities, fiscal responsibility, and building trust through listening. She said she would ask whether a decision benefits students, is financially responsible, and reflects input from those affected. She said if the district faces financial challenges, she would first look for ways to operate more efficiently and make better use of resources before cutting student opportunities.",
